 "known_limitations": [
  "Form-field-to-metric mapping is not configured for the International Bank return templates, so a brand-new filing cannot be pushed through automated metric extraction on stage. Demonstrate returns using the already ACCEPTED filing CV2-E02-2025-Q3.",
  "No UBO policy is configured, so entity_ubo_resolve returns CONFIGURATION_REQUIRED. Demonstrate ownership using the ownership network view, not the UBO panel.",
  "Legacy inspection tables are empty; supervision on-site work is demonstrated through the examinations module.",
  "There is no standalone regulatory-universe or risk-explainability route; both are shown inside the executive dashboard and prudential analysis screens.",
  "The aggregate entity risk score is recomputed by a worker-authenticated engine (risk-score-recompute) that is not invoked from the browser, so the stored score may pre-date the seeded Q3 breaches. Present risk using the breaches, actions and peer comparison evidence and disclose this openly if asked.",
  "The Piton demonstration group members have no accepted regulatory returns, so prudential_group_periods returns no common reporting period and no consolidated position can be computed. Present the Piton group as structure, hierarchy, legal ownership and consolidation treatment only; consolidated ratios are demonstrated on the Coral Harbour Bank prudential analysis screen."
 ]
